# AgroTech agent rules

Read `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, `docs/setup.md` and `docs/agents/architecture.md`
before changing code. Follow the spec-first flow and preserve the existing
vanilla JavaScript + Express architecture. Do not add frameworks, bundlers,
databases, ORMs or dependencies without an explicit decision.

Inspect real callers and contracts before editing. API changes update
`.ai/specs/05-openapi-spec.md`; business rules require tests in `tests/`;
changes to `src/`, `server.js` or `index.html` update a spec/task or state
`Spec: n/a — <reason>`.

Use Conventional Commits, never commit or push directly to `main`, and run
`npm run verify` before handoff. Validate untrusted input and enforce
authorization on the server.
